10 ' FRUIT INVADERS - a Space Invaders style game for Engine1999.
20 ' Keys: A or Z = move left, D or X = move right (the cannon keeps moving), S = stop, SPACE = fire, P = pause, Q = quit.
30 ' Shoot the invading fruit before it lands. Cherries are worth 30 points, apples 20, oranges 10, the pineapple 50 to 300.
40 ' The pictures are DESIGN rows (see docs/graphics-subsystem.md); the sounds are SFX effects; the shields are drawn on the graphics layer
50 ' and crumble where a bomb or a bullet hits them (POINT tells what is there). The language has no RND or INT: the program has its own random
60 ' number generator, and the integer variable Q% does the integer division.
70 GOTO MAIN
80 ' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- random numbers
90 ' RNG: R = a random number 0 .. RM-1 (RM at most 60000)
100 LABEL RNG
110 RS=(RS+1)*75:Q%=RS/65537:RS=RS-65537*Q%-1
120 Q%=RS/RM:R=RS-RM*Q%
130 RETURN
140 ' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- set up (once)
150 LABEL INIT
160 Q%=TI/65537:RS=1+TI-65537*Q%
170 ' (DIM n makes n elements, 0 to n-1)
180 DIM A(6,8),BX(3),BY(3),BO(3),MF(4),IM(6),ET(2),SV(4)
190 MF(0)=110:MF(1)=98:MF(2)=87:MF(3)=82
200 IM(1)=0:IM(2)=2:IM(3)=2:IM(4)=4:IM(5)=4
210 SV(0)=50:SV(1)=100:SV(2)=150:SV(3)=300
220 SX=36:SY=26:SHY=216:PY=262:UY=14
230 HI=0
240 ' sounds
250 SFX 1,"W1 V0.3 ML S1600,300,16"
260 SFX 2,"W3 V0.6 ML X0,0.01,0.25,0.08 S1500,120,16"
270 SFX 3,"W3 V1 ML X0,0.02,0.5,0.5 S700,35,2"
280 SFX 4,"W1 V0.5 ML S300,1900,16 S1900,300,16"
