4320 LABEL EFFECTS
4330 FOR I=0 TO 1
4340 IF ET(I)>0 THEN GOSUB ETICK
4350 NEXT I
4360 RETURN
4370 LABEL ETICK
4380 ET(I)=ET(I)-1
