4530 GFX VSYNC
4540 K$=INKEY$
4550 NEXT Z
4560 SPRITE 48,OFF
4570 IF LV<=0 THEN OV=1:RETURN
4580 PX=312:PD=0
4590 SPRITE 40,PX,PY,6:SPRITE 40,ON
4600 HF=1
4610 RETURN
